epson-tmt70ii-escpos (1.0.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - rastertoescpos CUPS raster filter (density, speed, 80/58 mm media,
      180 rotation, blank-space reduction, left margin, copies, cut).
    - tmt70 libusb backend for the vendor-class USB interface (04b8:0202),
      with file:// and socket:// sinks and a TMT70_DRYRUN dump mode.
    - EPSON_TM-T70II.ppd exposing the above as printer preferences.
    - udev rule granting the lp group access to the device.

 -- Quynn Bell <quynnbell@protonmail.com>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
